WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:09.759
A person sits down in front of a book with their focused gaze on its pages.

00:09.759 --> 00:21.604
The person holds writing utensils and has mathematical equations on their paper next to an open calculator.

00:21.604 --> 00:28.069
The young man's head rests on his hand as he gazes upwards.

00:28.069 --> 00:34.200
A laptop sits on a desk in front of him with cartoon characters displayed.

00:34.200 --> 00:39.205
A webpage about caffeine's effects on health appears in focus.

00:39.205 --> 00:44.961
A boy sits at his desk with a laptop in front of him.

00:44.961 --> 00:49.966
A person in a red jacket turns to look at something off-camera.

00:49.966 --> 00:55.930
The person holding an orange lid places it on a jar filled with black contents.

00:55.930 --> 01:01.895
Freshly ground dark coffee beans fill a large bowl on the counter.

01:01.895 --> 01:07.400
Liquid is being poured into a clear measuring cup.

01:07.400 --> 01:13.156
The person's hand interacts with electronic equipment in the background.

01:13.156 --> 01:18.828
The person's hand holds a small black container with coffee over tools on a table.

01:18.828 --> 01:24.042
The oven's control panel shows visible damage with exposed wires.

01:24.042 --> 01:29.672
A coffee cup with steam inside it comes into focus in front of a blurred background.

01:29.672 --> 01:36.262
A metallic tray with a small white coffee cup sits on top of it.

01:36.262 --> 01:42.727
The person pours dark coffee from a silver pitcher into their cup.

01:42.727 --> 01:48.274
The person holds up a bag of coffee beans with "Café Colombón" label.

01:48.274 --> 01:50.610
The packet of coffee reads "COFFEE FREE" with 100% Arabica.
